# rmhOS: the desktop owns tty1 (started by rmhos-agent). There is no login console: root is locked
# and the visitor's account is created per session without a password, so a getty could not be
# used by anyone. The serial0 log (rmhos-agent lines, Xorg errors) is what explains a failed start.
::sysinit:/sbin/openrc sysinit
::sysinit:/sbin/openrc boot
::wait:/sbin/openrc default

::ctrlaltdel:/sbin/reboot
::shutdown:/sbin/openrc shutdown
